    WHERE
        `a weapon or an imitation of one` MEANS
            `s 270 helper: at least one of these holds` (LIST facts's `the accused carries, uses or threatens to use a weapon, by s 2 weapon`, JUST (facts's `the accused carries, uses or threatens to use an imitation of a weapon`))

